<title>USA: Gleason Corp says completed merger.</title>
<headline>Gleason Corp says completed merger.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gleason Corp, a maker of gear production equipment, said Thursday that it completed its acquisition of Germany's Hermann Pfauter Group.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that Pfauter, a privately held manufacturer of machinery and tooling for the production of cylindrical gears, was bought for $34.8 million in cash and the assumption of $56 million in bank debt.</p>
</text>
